{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02C580","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"……那附近应该有一座旧堡垒。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"怎么了，Paz？你的声音听起来很沉重。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":"JPN_DARK_VOICE_TONE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯……那个，这座堡垒是内战时期留下的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"JPN_ERA_NOT_EXPLICITLY_BUILT"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"就是执政党和在野党的争端最终发展成战争的那场内战吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_SPLIT_REJOINED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"嗯。就是夺走我祖父母生命的那场内战……同一个国家的人彼此残杀，最愚蠢的战争……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"JPN_STUPIDEST_WAR_WORDING_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那座堡垒上就刻着那种愚蠢。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"JPN_ETCHED_IMAGERY_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"真讽刺。如今雇佣兵又盘踞在那座堡垒里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"JPN_MERCENARIES_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"正因为反省那场内战，哥斯达黎加才废除了军队……拜托你，Snake，把他们赶出去！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":"JPN_REFLECTION_CAUSALITY_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"交给我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_REPLY_PRIMARY"}]}